<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CSN plans no &quot;abrupt&quot; CVRD changes.</title>
<headline>Brazil CSN plans no &quot;abrupt&quot; CVRD changes.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Valepar consortium plans no &quot;abrupt&quot; changes to Companhia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD) after buying a controlling stake, said Benjamin Steinbruch, chairman of Brazilian steelmaker CSN.</p>
<p>Steinbruch, whose company heads the consortium, said it did not plan to split up CVRD, or lay off workers and added he was &quot;100 percent calm&quot; about the CVRD privatization process, despite a court injunction apparently suspending the auction result.</p>
</text>
